sentences.text:
Even as per the version of the complainant,
the following facts have been emerged:
(i) 4 years prior to the FIR being lodged on 1st October 2020, accused No. 1 followed the prosecutrix and told her that he loved her and she should also love him;
(ii) After a period of 2 years, she agreed to love him and both were intimate with each other;
(iii) One year prior to the date of the incident, accused No. 1 took the prosecutrix to his aunty's house in Chitradurga and they stayed there.
